# Development files that must not end up in the app bundle (#37). The store readme (README.txt, README.de.txt), assets,
# locales and drivers stay. Patterns with a leading slash match only at the repository root. The dot-directories are also
# covered by the CLI's default `.*` rule; they are listed so the intent is explicit.
/docs/
/scripts/
/CLAUDE.md
/README.md
/eslint.config.mjs
/.github/
/.claude/
/.hwtest/
/.venv/
